# Assistive Technologies Meet Students' Needs.

**Authors:** Grisham, Kenneth L.

## Abstract
Discusses the role of institutions of higher education in the provision of assistive technology to meet students' needs. New forms of assistive technology, especially digital applications, are raising new issues of accessibility. Professionals at institutions of higher education must be well informed about technology changes to enable students and to ensure that barriers to participation are removed. (SLD)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ674989

